@1 = ~The craftsmanship is oddly familiar. This... this is a Soul Coin that ensnares captured souls. It's mostly irrelevant in Toril but... I might find some use for it. If you're open to negotiate?~
@2 = ~How much?~
@3 = ~I'll give it to you for 10000 gold.~
@4 = ~I think I'll keep it.~
@5 = ~I offer you 400 gold coins and not a penny more. It isn't THAT desired to expand the offer, if you catch my drift.~
@6 = ~Yes.~
@7 = ~No.~
@8 = ~Your sense of humour is intact but unamusing.~
@9 = ~Offer's still on the table, should you reconsider.~
